-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"א/1, 26 July 2020: העסקת עו"ה, עובדי בעלות, בבתי ספר
-- לחינוך מיוחד מוכרים שאינם רשמיים, בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"א
-- אופק חדש in the recognised unofficial special-education schools: who does
-- what to apply it, who joins, the work week, part-time and above-100%
-- employment, mothers and age hours, principals and deputies, school
-- activity hours, leaving the reform, promotion, counsellors, the grade and
-- the salary conversion, the advances, the attendance clock, and the
-- annexes (the owner's commitment, three forms, and the conversion rules
-- with their worked examples).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in MONTHS from the event each
-- rule names (signing, joining, the end of maternity leave). Weekly hours
-- are hours for a full position unless a rule says otherwise.

§ `חוזר תשפ"א/1 אופק חדש בבתי ספר לחינוך מיוחד מוכרים שאינם רשמיים`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (26.7.2020), reference number, addressee (the owners of recognised unofficial special-education schools not yet in אופק חדש), greeting and subject line; no rule.

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_1/p1 Background: the State's undertaking in HCJ 148/18 (WIZO v. Ministry of Education) to equalise teaching resources from תש"ף; it states the reason, not a rule.
-- akn:art_1/p2 Background: the inter-ministerial team and the Director-General's decision to adopt its conclusions; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p3 A pointer to the team's report; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p4 The report's link; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p5 The rest of the report's link; no rule.

-- ¶6: from תש"ף the terms of אופק חדש apply to the recognised unofficial
-- special-education schools.
@ref akn:art_1/p6
GIVEN `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year in which the school year begins (תש"ף = 2019)
      `recognised unofficial special-education school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `אופק חדש applies to the school` `school year beginning` `recognised unofficial special-education school` IF
        `recognised unofficial special-education school`
    AND `school year beginning` AT LEAST 2019

-- ¶7 (and 14.1, and annex E ¶5): the Ministry of Education alone approves
-- joining, sets the grade, converts the salary, and sets the education
-- grade and the seniority.
@ref akn:art_1/p7 akn:art_14__para_14-1 akn:att_5__hc_1/p5
DECLARE `reform decision` IS ONE OF
    `approving a teacher's joining`
    `setting the אופק חדש grade`
    `converting the salary`
    `setting the education grade`
    `setting the seniority in teaching`

GIVEN d IS A `reform decision`
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides` d IS
    `the Ministry of Education`

-- akn:art_1/p8 The circular's purpose: to explain the instructions for תשפ"א, following circular תש"ף/1; no rule beyond the sections below.
-- akn:art_1/p9 The link to circular תש"ף/1; no rule.

§§ `2 תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה`

DECLARE `reform action` IS ONE OF
    `sign the commitment to apply אופק חדש`
    `check and update the teachers' data`
    `have unreported teachers open an online file`
    `identify the teachers who meet the joining conditions`
    `employ the eligible teachers on אופק חדש terms`
    `attend the pedagogical training`
    `guide the teachers in opening an online file`
    `set the timetable by the אופק חדש work week`
    `place all the teachers in the placement system`
    `transfer the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
    `check each teacher's joining conditions`
    `determine the grade`
    `compute the school's אופק חדש profile`
    `indemnify the owner for the approved teachers`
    `pay by the grade from joining, less the advances` HAS `retro salary paid` IS A NUMBER
    `impose sanctions on the owner`
    `monitor the academic-studies commitment`
    `present proof of an academic degree`
    `complete the degree and the teaching certificate`
    `employ in a third school`
    `employ above the scope approved` HAS `scope above 100%` IS A NUMBER
    `allocate school-activity hours` HAS `activity hours in the half` IS A NUMBER
    `report the hours on the attendance clock`
    `pay and deduct by the clock reports`
    `pay the אופק חדש advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER

-- 2.1, the owner's actions: 1. sign the commitment of annex A until the
-- regulations (Education (Recognised Institutions), 1953) are amended;
-- 2. check and update the teachers' data in the עוש"ר report (א) and have
-- teachers not yet reported — health professions and arts therapists
-- among them — open an online file (ב), under the circular on candidates
-- for employment for תשפ"א; 3. identify the teachers who meet the joining
-- conditions (section 3); 4. employ them on the pay and the work week of
-- אופק חדש (section 4). No deadline is printed. Breaking the commitment may
-- bring sanctions, up to the licence (annex A ¶4).
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1 akn:art_2__para_2-1/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_3 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_4/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the owner's first stage` IS
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `sign the commitment to apply אופק חדש`
     LEST  (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
            MAY   `impose sanctions on the owner`))
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `check and update the teachers' data`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `have unreported teachers open an online file`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `identify the teachers who meet the joining conditions`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `employ the eligible teachers on אופק חדש terms`)

-- 2.1, the principal's actions: attend the pedagogical training; guide
-- the teachers (health professions and arts therapists included) in
-- opening an online file; set the timetable by the אופק חדש work week;
-- place every teacher — on reform or pre-reform terms — in the placement
-- system (משכית).
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_4/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_4__cls_1 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_4__cls_2 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_4__cls_3 akn:art_2__para_2-1__subpara_4__cls_4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the principal's first stage` IS
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `attend the pedagogical training`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `guide the teachers in opening an online file`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `set the timetable by the אופק חדש work week`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `place all the teachers in the placement system`)

-- 2.2: the owner transfers the salary interface to the contractor (Unique)
-- for the month asked; the Ministry checks the joining conditions, sets
-- the grade, computes the school's profile and indemnifies; once the grade
-- is set and the owner updated, the owner pays by the grade from the day
-- of joining and deducts the advances of section 15.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2 akn:art_2__para_2-2/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p1 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p4 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p5 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p6 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p7
GIVEN `salary by the grade from joining` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary due under the grade set, from the day of joining, in shekels; an input
      `advances paid` IS A NUMBER @desc the אופק חדש advances paid under section 15, in shekels
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `the second stage` `salary by the grade from joining` `advances paid` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `transfer the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
    HENCE ((PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
            MUST  `check each teacher's joining conditions`)
           RAND
           (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
            MUST  `determine the grade`
            HENCE (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
                   MUST  `pay by the grade from joining, less the advances` `paid`
                         PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `salary by the grade from joining` MINUS `advances paid`))
           RAND
           (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
            MUST  `compute the school's אופק חדש profile`))

-- 2.2 ¶8-¶9: the Ministry indemnifies the owner, in the payments system,
-- for the teachers approved for employment on אופק חדש, by its pay terms and
-- work week — and cannot without the placement system updated to the
-- אופק חדש work week and the salary interface transferred.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p8 akn:art_2__para_2-2__subpara_2/p9
GIVEN `placement system updated to the work week` IS A BOOLEAN
      `salary interface transferred` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry can indemnify the owner` `placement system updated to the work week` `salary interface transferred` IF
        `placement system updated to the work week`
    AND `salary interface transferred`

GIVEN `placement system updated to the work week` IS A BOOLEAN
      `salary interface transferred` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `indemnifying the owner` `placement system updated to the work week` `salary interface transferred` IS
    IF `the Ministry can indemnify the owner` `placement system updated to the work week` `salary interface transferred`
    THEN PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
         MUST  `indemnify the owner for the approved teachers`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `3 תנאי ההצטרפות`

@desc A teaching employee of the owner at a special-education school, as far as the circular asks about him.
DECLARE `special-education teacher` HAS
    `recognised years of actual teaching` IS A NUMBER  @desc years of actual teaching recognised for salary seniority, internship and military or national service in teaching excluded (3.1)
    `seniority in teaching`              IS A NUMBER  @desc years of seniority in teaching, as the Ministry sets it
    `holds an academic degree`           IS A BOOLEAN @desc or an equivalent salary grade approved by the Ministry's teaching-staff division
    `holds a teaching certificate`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `position fraction`                  IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position (1 = 100%)
    `in special education`               IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in special education (the joining floor is 1/3); otherwise regular education (1/2)
    `signed the academic-studies commitment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved as an exception`           IS A BOOLEAN @desc the exceptions committee approved joining without a teaching certificate
    `an intern`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `a health-profession or arts therapist` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teacher age`                        IS A NUMBER

-- 3.1.1-3.1.2: a "new" teacher has no recognised years of actual teaching;
-- an "existing" teacher is entitled to have such years recognised.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-1 akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1 akn:art_3__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing teacher` t IF
    t's `recognised years of actual teaching` GREATER THAN 0

GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teacher` t IF
    NOT `an existing teacher` t

-- 3.2.1: an existing academic (or one with an equivalent salary grade the
-- teaching-staff division approved) in an institution that joined joins with
-- a teaching certificate and at least a third of a position; without the
-- certificate he asks the exceptions committee on annex B, through the
-- institutions' portal.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p1 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p2 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p3 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p4 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p5 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p6 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p7 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p8 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p9
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing academic joins` t IF
        `an existing teacher` t
    AND t's `holds an academic degree`
    AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    AND (t's `holds a teaching certificate` OR t's `approved as an exception`)

-- 3.2.1 ¶10-¶11: without a teaching certificate and with less than 25
-- years, no advancement in grades until certified (12.2.2).
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p10 akn:art_3__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p11
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred from advancing until certified` t IF
        (NOT t's `holds a teaching certificate`)
    AND t's `seniority in teaching` LESS THAN 25

-- 3.3.1-3.3.2: an existing non-academic with up to 27 years (inclusive)
-- joins once he signs the commitment to complete an academic education
-- within four years (annex C, through the portal); with 28 years or more he
-- need not sign and is employed on the reform's terms in any case.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1 akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-2
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing non-academic joins` t IF
        `an existing teacher` t
    AND (NOT t's `holds an academic degree`)
    AND (t's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 28 OR t's `signed the academic-studies commitment`)

-- 3.3.4 (and annex C ¶9-¶10): a teacher who presents the degree within four
-- years of joining is owed the salary differences back to the day of
-- joining; one who completes later moves to the academic table without
-- them. The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_01-g): one start for both,
-- the day of joining the reform (3.3.4, the clause that sets the
-- entitlement). For a teacher who signs as he joins, the days coincide.
-- Time in months from it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-4 akn:att_3__hc_1/p9 akn:att_3__hc_1/p10
`months to complete the degree` MEANS 48

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `completing the academic degree` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `present proof of an academic degree`
    WITHIN `months to complete the degree`
    LEST  (PARTY `the teaching employee`
           MAY   `present proof of an academic degree`)

GIVEN `months from joining to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `retroactive salary differences from joining` `months from joining to the degree` IF
    `months from joining to the degree` AT MOST `months to complete the degree`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_01-g: the four years run from SIGNING the commitment
-- (3.3.1, annex C ¶9) and from JOINING the reform (3.3.4, annex C ¶10);
-- the salary differences run back to the day of JOINING (3.3.4) and to
-- the day of SIGNING (annex C ¶10).
DECLARE `start of the four years` IS ONE OF
    `the day the commitment was signed`
    `the day of joining the reform`

`the starts the text gives for the four years` MEANS
    LIST `the day the commitment was signed`, `the day of joining the reform`
`the starts the text gives for the differences` MEANS
    LIST `the day of joining the reform`, `the day the commitment was signed`

`the four years and the differences each start on two days` MEANS
        count `the starts the text gives for the four years` EQUALS 2
    AND count `the starts the text gives for the differences` EQUALS 2
    AND NOT (at `the starts the text gives for the four years` 0 EQUALS at `the starts the text gives for the four years` 1)
#ASSERT `the four years and the differences each start on two days`

-- 3.3.3: the owner monitors the commitment.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `monitoring the commitment` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `monitor the academic-studies commitment`

-- 3.4: a new teacher joins with an academic degree (or an equivalent
-- grade), a teaching certificate and at least a third of a position — half
-- a position in regular education.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-4
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `joining position floor` t IS
    IF t's `in special education` THEN 1 DIVIDED BY 3 ELSE 0.5

GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teacher joins` t IF
        `a new teacher` t
    AND t's `holds an academic degree`
    AND t's `holds a teaching certificate`
    AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST `joining position floor` t

-- 3.5.1: in a school that joined, interns are employed on the reform's
-- terms only; the internship year counts only at a third of a position or
-- more.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5 akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an intern is employed on the reform` t IF
    t's `an intern`

GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year is recognised` t IF
        t's `an intern`
    AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- 3.5.2: the internship lasts at most two years, in which the intern
-- completes the degree and the teaching certificate; otherwise no further
-- employment on the reform's terms. Time in months.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `completing the internship requirements` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `complete the degree and the teaching certificate`
    WITHIN 24
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/1 3.5.2: an intern who has not completed the degree and certificate within two years is not employed further on the reform's terms"

-- 3.5.3: what the internship counts for: not salary seniority or the
-- minimum time for promotion; yes tenure, jubilee-grant and recuperation
-- seniority.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3
DECLARE `seniority purpose` IS ONE OF
    `salary seniority`
    `the minimum time for promotion (פז"נ)`
    `tenure`
    `seniority for the jubilee grant`
    `seniority for recuperation pay`

GIVEN p IS A `seniority purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `salary seniority` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the minimum time for promotion (פז"נ)` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 3.6: a substitute on weekly hours is employed on the terms of the
-- teacher replaced.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3-6
GIVEN `the replaced teacher is on the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `on weekly hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is on the reform` `the replaced teacher is on the reform` `on weekly hours` IF
    `on weekly hours` AND `the replaced teacher is on the reform`

§§ `3 Who joins (3.2-3.5 together)`

GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins the reform` t IF
       `an intern is employed on the reform` t
    OR `an existing academic joins` t
    OR `an existing non-academic joins` t
    OR `a new teacher joins` t

§§ `4 מבנה שבוע העבודה למורים ברפורמה`

-- 4.1: a full position is five working days, even where the school works
-- six.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1
`working days a week at a full position` MEANS 5

-- 4.2: in a primary special-education school (grades 1-6, 1-8 or 1-9),
-- every teacher (on a 30- or a kept 24-hour base alike) works the primary
-- week. 4.3: in a multi-stage school, grades 1-6 (a kept 24-hour base
-- included) the primary week, grades 7-12 the post-primary one.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2 akn:art_4__para_4-3
DECLARE `work week` IS ONE OF
    `the primary special-education week`
    `the post-primary special-education week`

DECLARE `kind of school` IS ONE OF
    `primary school (grades 1-6, 1-8 or 1-9)`
    `multi-stage school`

GIVEN s IS A `kind of school`, `grade taught` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the work week for` s `grade taught` IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `primary school (grades 1-6, 1-8 or 1-9)` THEN `the primary special-education week`
    WHEN `multi-stage school` THEN IF `grade taught` AT MOST 6
                                   THEN `the primary special-education week`
                                   ELSE `the post-primary special-education week`

-- 4.4 and 4.6: 36 hours: 26 frontal, 5 individual (up to 3 pupils, the
-- content set by the principal under the Ministry's general guidance) and 5
-- stay hours in primary; 23, 4 and 9 in post-primary. Of the stay hours,
-- working meetings take up to 2 (primary) or 4 (post-primary); the rest go
-- to the listed activities.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-4 akn:art_4__para_4-6
@desc A full position's weekly hours by kind.
DECLARE `week hours` HAS
    `total hours`        IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours`      IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours`   IS A NUMBER  @desc with up to 3 pupils, content set by the principal under the Ministry's general guidance
    `stay hours`         IS A NUMBER
    `meeting hours at most` IS A NUMBER @desc of the stay hours, the most that may go to working meetings

GIVEN w IS A `work week`
GIVETH A `week hours`
DECIDE `the teacher's week` w IS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `the primary special-education week` THEN `week hours` 36 26 5 5 2
    WHEN `the post-primary special-education week` THEN `week hours` 36 23 4 9 4

DECLARE `stay activity` IS ONE OF
    `working meetings`
    `adapting the curriculum and environment to the pupil`
    `individual meetings with parents`
    `checking work and tests`
    `preparing for and taking part in committees`
    `planning and guiding the special-education assistants`
    `coordination for the pupil's integration in the community`
    `coordination for educational continuity`

GIVEN a IS A `stay activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a stay-hour activity` a IF TRUE

-- 4.5 and 4.7 (with art_4 ¶1-¶3, the link printed after 4.7): health
-- professions (occupational therapy, physiotherapy, speech therapy) and
-- arts therapists work the teacher's week with other individual and stay
-- hours; two stay hours may go to moving between institutions.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-5 akn:art_4__para_4-7 akn:art_4/p1 akn:art_4/p2 akn:art_4/p3
GIVEN w IS A `work week`
GIVETH A `week hours`
DECIDE `the therapist's week` w IS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `the primary special-education week` THEN `week hours` 36 26 3 7 2
    WHEN `the post-primary special-education week` THEN `week hours` 36 23 2 11 4

`stay hours a therapist may use to move between institutions` MEANS 2

§§ `5 העסקה בחלקיות משרה ברפורמה`

-- 5.1-5.2: at least a third of a position, save health professions.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-2
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be employed at that scope on the reform` t IF
       t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    OR t's `a health-profession or arts therapist`

-- 5.3: a part-time position is cut from each kind of hour in proportion.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-3/p1
GIVEN h IS A `week hours`, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `week hours`
DECIDE `the part-time week` h f IS
    `week hours` (h's `total hours` TIMES f) (h's `frontal hours` TIMES f) (h's `individual hours` TIMES f) (h's `stay hours` TIMES f) (h's `meeting hours at most` TIMES f)

-- 5.3 ¶2: a therapist below a third, or a teacher of a required subject
-- below a third by special approval, at three frontal hours or fewer,
-- teaches those hours only; the position is their ratio to the base.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-3/p2
`single frontal hours at most` MEANS 3

GIVEN `frontal hours taught` IS A NUMBER, `position base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `single-hours position` `frontal hours taught` `position base` IS
    `frontal hours taught` DIVIDED BY `position base`

-- 5.4: no more than two schools, and no more than 100% at all of them,
-- save health professions and subjects the division allows in more schools.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-4
GIVEN `schools already employing` IS A NUMBER
      `exempt from the two-school limit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `no third school` `schools already employing` `exempt from the two-school limit` IS
    IF `schools already employing` AT LEAST 2 AND NOT `exempt from the two-school limit`
    THEN PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
         SHANT `employ in a third school`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/1 5.4: a teacher works in no more than two schools"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 5.5: time below a third does not count toward the minimum period for
-- promotion.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-5
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts toward פז"נ` t IF
    t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

§§ `6 העסקה מעל 100% משרה ברפורמה`

-- 6.1-6.2: up to 100% as a rule; above it, exceptionally, for a teacher
-- (not a principal or first deputy), by the criteria; the extra hours
-- frontal only, the total at most 8.5 a day and 42 a week. 6.3: the
-- placement system allows up to 117%; 6.4: above that, the division's
-- headquarters approve.
DECLARE `above-100% criterion` IS ONE OF
    `a required subject: science, English, mathematics or physical education`
    `a shortage of teachers in the area`
    `a remote locality where the institution struggles to recruit`

@ref akn:art_6__para_6-1 akn:art_6__para_6-2
GIVEN `a principal or first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN
      `criteria met` IS A LIST OF `above-100% criterion`
      `extra hours all frontal` IS A BOOLEAN
      `hours a day` IS A NUMBER
      `hours a week` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be approved above 100%` `a principal or first deputy` `criteria met` `extra hours all frontal` `hours a day` `hours a week` IF
        (NOT `a principal or first deputy`)
    AND (NOT null `criteria met`)
    AND `extra hours all frontal`
    AND `hours a day` AT MOST 8.5
    AND `hours a week` AT MOST 42

-- 6.3: the placement system allows an exceptional placement up to 117%, by
-- the school's needs; 6.4: above 117%, the teaching-staff division's
-- headquarters approve, through the entitlements system.
@ref akn:art_6__para_6-3 akn:art_6__para_6-4
DECLARE `who approves the scope` IS ONE OF
    `no approval needed`
    `exceptional placement in the placement system`
    `the teaching-staff division's headquarters`

GIVEN `scope` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `who approves the scope`
DECIDE `who approves` `scope` IS
    IF `scope` AT MOST 1
    THEN `no approval needed`
    ELSE IF `scope` AT MOST 1.17
         THEN `exceptional placement in the placement system`
         ELSE `the teaching-staff division's headquarters`

§§ `7 עו"ה אם`

@desc A teaching employee who is a mother, or back from maternity leave, as far as section 7 asks.
DECLARE `mother teacher` HAS
    `mother position fraction`          IS A NUMBER  @desc the whole position, at all its parts
    `entitled to a mother's position under the takanon` IS A BOOLEAN
    `months since maternity leave ended` IS A NUMBER @desc months since the end of maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law; 99 where none

-- 7.1: a mother's position by the takanon: at 79% or more in all.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-1
GIVEN m IS A `mother teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has a mother's position` m IF
        m's `entitled to a mother's position under the takanon`
    AND m's `mother position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79

-- 7.3: back from maternity leave at 90% or more: for four months, one
-- nursing hour a day off the stay hours (five a week), with no cut in pay
-- or position; 7.2 does not apply meanwhile.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-3
GIVEN m IS A `mother teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `nursing hours under 7.3` m IF
        m's `mother position fraction` AT LEAST 0.90
    AND m's `months since maternity leave ended` LESS THAN 4

-- 7.4: back from maternity leave at "79% to 90%": the stay-hour reduction
-- of a part-time mother (7.2).
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-4
GIVEN m IS A `mother teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `mother's reduction under 7.4` m IF
        m's `mother position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79
    AND m's `mother position fraction` AT MOST 0.90
    AND m's `months since maternity leave ended` LESS THAN 4

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_01-b: at exactly 90%, both 7.3 and 7.4 apply, and 7.5
-- forbids both reductions together.
`a mother back from leave at 90%` MEANS
    `mother teacher` WITH
        `mother position fraction`          IS 0.90
        `entitled to a mother's position under the takanon` IS TRUE
        `months since maternity leave ended` IS 1

`at 90% both 7.3 and 7.4 apply` MEANS
        `nursing hours under 7.3` `a mother back from leave at 90%`
    AND `mother's reduction under 7.4` `a mother back from leave at 90%`
#ASSERT `at 90% both 7.3 and 7.4 apply`

-- 7.2 and 7.5, with the reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_01-b): at 90%,
-- 7.3 governs ("90% ומעלה"), 7.4's "עד 90%" read as below it. A mother's
-- position takes one frontal and one stay hour off the week; never both
-- reductions at once.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-2 akn:art_7__para_7-5
DECLARE `mother reduction` IS ONE OF
    `none`
    `one frontal and one stay hour a week`
    `five nursing hours a week off the stay hours`

GIVEN m IS A `mother teacher`
GIVETH A `mother reduction`
DECIDE `the mother's reduction` m IS
    IF `nursing hours under 7.3` m
    THEN `five nursing hours a week off the stay hours`
    ELSE IF `has a mother's position` m
         THEN `one frontal and one stay hour a week`
         ELSE `none`

§§ `8 מורים הזכאים לשעות גיל`

DECLARE `age reduction` HAS
    `frontal hours off`    IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours off` IS A NUMBER
    `position base after`  IS A NUMBER

-- 8.1: the age of entitlement is as before the reform. 8.2: existing and
-- new teachers (3.1) aged 50-55: two frontal hours off a full position,
-- pro-rated for a part position; the position base falls to 34 hours.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-1 akn:art_8__para_8-2
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 50-55 band of 8.2` t IF
    t's `teacher age` AT LEAST 50 AND t's `teacher age` AT MOST 55

`the reduction of 8.2` MEANS `age reduction` 2 0 34

-- 8.3: existing teachers (3.1.2) aged 55 and over: three frontal and one
-- individual hour off a full position, pro-rated; the base falls to 32.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-3
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 55-and-over band of 8.3` t IF
    `an existing teacher` t AND t's `teacher age` AT LEAST 55

`the reduction of 8.3` MEANS `age reduction` 3 1 32

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_01-a: an existing teacher aged 55 is in both bands.
`an existing teacher aged 55` MEANS
    `special-education teacher` WITH
        `recognised years of actual teaching` IS 25
        `seniority in teaching`              IS 25
        `holds an academic degree`           IS TRUE
        `holds a teaching certificate`       IS TRUE
        `position fraction`                  IS 1
        `in special education`               IS TRUE
        `signed the academic-studies commitment` IS FALSE
        `approved as an exception`           IS FALSE
        `an intern`                          IS FALSE
        `a health-profession or arts therapist` IS FALSE
        `teacher age`                        IS 55

`an existing teacher of 55 is in 8.2 and in 8.3` MEANS
        `in the 50-55 band of 8.2` `an existing teacher aged 55`
    AND `in the 55-and-over band of 8.3` `an existing teacher aged 55`
#ASSERT `an existing teacher of 55 is in 8.2 and in 8.3`

-- 8.4: new teachers (3.1.1) aged 55 and over: two frontal hours only, base
-- 34, pro-rated — no further reduction beyond the one given at 50.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-4
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 55-and-over band of 8.4` t IF
    `a new teacher` t AND t's `teacher age` AT LEAST 55

`the reduction of 8.4` MEANS `age reduction` 2 0 34

§§ `8 The age reduction (8.2-8.4 together)`

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_01-a): 55 belongs to the band that
-- opens at it (8.3 and 8.4), 8.2's "50-55" read as up to 55. The reduction
-- is pro-rated for a part-time position.
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A `age reduction`
DECIDE `the age reduction` t IS
    IF `in the 55-and-over band of 8.3` t
    THEN `the reduction of 8.3`
    ELSE IF `in the 55-and-over band of 8.4` t
         THEN `the reduction of 8.4`
         ELSE IF `in the 50-55 band of 8.2` t
              THEN `the reduction of 8.2`
              ELSE `age reduction` 0 0 36

GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `frontal age hours off` t IS
    (`the age reduction` t)'s `frontal hours off` TIMES min (t's `position fraction`) 1

§§ `9 מבנה שבוע העבודה למנהלים וסגנים ראשונים`

-- 9.1: a principal and a first deputy at exactly 100%, five days.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-1
GIVEN `scope` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a lawful scope for a principal or first deputy` `scope` IF
    `scope` EQUALS 1

-- 9.2 and 9.7: a 40-hour week.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-2 akn:art_9__para_9-7
`the principal's and first deputy's week` MEANS 40

-- 9.3-9.4: eight complexity levels, by the school-management index
-- (classes, kinds of disability, stages); in special education the lowest
-- is 3. 9.5: computed in early May of the previous year from that month's
-- data. 9.6: a new institution gets the minimum until December, then the
-- computed level back to the start of the year.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-3 akn:art_9__para_9-4 akn:art_9__para_9-5 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p1
GIVEN `computed level` IS A NUMBER @desc the level the school-management index gives, 1 to 8
      `a new institution before December` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `complexity level` `computed level` `a new institution before December` IS
    IF `a new institution before December`
    THEN 3
    ELSE max 3 `computed level`

-- 9.6's table: the principal's frontal teaching hours by complexity level,
-- one row per printed line (9.2: 6-9 hours).
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-6/p2 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p3 akn:art_9__para_9-6/t1 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p4 akn:art_9__para_9-6/p5
DECLARE `complexity row` HAS
    `complexity level of the row` IS A NUMBER
    `frontal teaching hours`      IS A NUMBER

`the principal's frontal hours` MEANS
    LIST `complexity row` 3 9, `complexity row` 4 8, `complexity row` 5 8,
         `complexity row` 6 7, `complexity row` 7 7, `complexity row` 8 6

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-1
`the primary first deputy's frontal hours` MEANS
    LIST `complexity row` 3 21, `complexity row` 4 21, `complexity row` 5 20,
         `complexity row` 6 20, `complexity row` 7 19, `complexity row` 8 18

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-2
`the post-primary first deputy's frontal hours` MEANS
    LIST `complexity row` 3 11, `complexity row` 4 11, `complexity row` 5 11,
         `complexity row` 6 11, `complexity row` 7 9, `complexity row` 8 9

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-7__subpara_9-7-3
`the multi-stage first deputy's frontal hours` MEANS
    LIST `complexity row` 3 15, `complexity row` 4 15, `complexity row` 5 14,
         `complexity row` 6 14, `complexity row` 7 13, `complexity row` 8 13

§§ `9 Reading the complexity tables`

GIVEN `table` IS A LIST OF `complexity row`
      `level` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `frontal hours at level` `table` `level` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `frontal teaching hours`)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `complexity level of the row` EQUALS `level`) `table`))

-- 9.8: a second deputy works a teacher's week, the individual hours on
-- the deputy's work. 9.9: a principal or first deputy entitled to a
-- mother's position: two weekly hours off the non-frontal hours. 9.10: at
-- 50 or over, two hours off likewise; neither changes pay or position.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-8
`the second deputy's week` MEANS `the teacher's week`

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-9 akn:art_9__para_9-10
GIVEN `a mother entitled to a mother's position` IS A BOOLEAN, `age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `non-frontal hours off for a principal or first deputy` `a mother entitled to a mother's position` `age` IS
    (IF `a mother entitled to a mother's position` THEN 2 ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `age` AT LEAST 50 THEN 2 ELSE 0)

§§ `10 שעות פעילות בית ספרית`

DECLARE `school activity` IS ONE OF
    `a general school assembly`
    `individual parent-and-child meetings`
    `activity after school hours`

-- 10.1: a teacher on the reform, at any position, is paid for school
-- activities on top of his position and fixed salary.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1
GIVEN `employed on the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid for school activities on top of the salary` `employed on the reform` IF
    `employed on the reform`

-- 10.3: the purposes, each with its own cap a half-year.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-3
GIVEN a IS A `school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `cap a half-year` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `a general school assembly` THEN 4
    WHEN `individual parent-and-child meetings` THEN 8
    WHEN `activity after school hours` THEN 6

-- 10.2: allocated by the school's needs; in no case more than 18 hours to a
-- teacher in a half-year.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-2
`school-activity hours a half-year at most` MEANS 18

-- The three caps add up to the 18.
`the three caps add up to 18` MEANS
    sum (map `cap a half-year` (LIST `a general school assembly`, `individual parent-and-child meetings`, `activity after school hours`))
    EQUALS `school-activity hours a half-year at most`
#ASSERT `the three caps add up to 18`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `no more than 18 activity hours a half` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    SHANT `allocate school-activity hours` `hours`
          PROVIDED `hours` GREATER THAN `school-activity hours a half-year at most`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/1 10.2: no more than 18 school-activity hours a half-year"

§§ `11 יציאה מאופק חדש`

-- 11.1: everyone who meets the conditions joins; 11.2: exceptionally, a
-- request to leave may be heard on these grounds; 11.3-11.4: on annex D's
-- form, through the institutions' portal.
DECLARE `ground for leaving` IS ONE OF
    `the health of the teacher or a first-degree relative, with current medical certificates`
    `humanitarian: a change for the worse in the teacher's circumstances after joining`
    `another ground`

@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1 akn:art_11__para_11-2 akn:art_11__para_11-3 akn:art_11__para_11-4
GIVEN g IS A `ground for leaving`, `on annex D through the portal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request to leave may be heard` g `on annex D through the portal` IF
        `on annex D through the portal`
    AND NOT (g EQUALS `another ground`)

§§ `12 קידום בדרגות הערכה ופיתוח מקצועי`

-- 12.1: promotion needs the minimum time (פז"נ), the professional-
-- development hours (שפ"מ) and an evaluation, by the Ministry's rules.
@desc One step of a promotion table: the step, the minimum time in months, the development hours and the rise in the tabular salary.
DECLARE `promotion step` HAS
    `step from`          IS A STRING
    `minimum months`     IS A NUMBER
    `development hours`  IS A NUMBER
    `salary rise`        IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-1
GIVEN s IS A `promotion step`
      `months in the grade` IS A NUMBER
      `development hours done` IS A NUMBER
      `evaluated as the Ministry directs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be promoted` s `months in the grade` `development hours done` `evaluated as the Ministry directs` IF
        `months in the grade` AT LEAST s's `minimum months`
    AND `development hours done` AT LEAST s's `development hours`
    AND `evaluated as the Ministry directs`

-- 12.2.1: academic, certified teachers.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_12-2-1
`promotion of certified academic teachers` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "1-2" 30 120 0.075, `promotion step` "2-3" 30 120 0.075,
         `promotion step` "3-4" 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` "4-5" 36 180 0.075,
         `promotion step` "5-6" 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` "6-7" 48 210 0.075,
         `promotion step` "7-8" 48 210 0.075, `promotion step` "8-9" 48 210 0.075

-- 12.2.3: certified non-academic teachers with 28 years or more.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_12-2-3
`promotion of certified non-academic teachers` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "1-2" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "2-3" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "3-4" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "4-5" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "5-6" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "6-7" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "7-8" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "8-9" 48 480 0.075

-- 12.3.1-12.3.2: principals and deputies.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-3 akn:art_12__para_12-3__subpara_12-3-1
`promotion of certified academic principals and deputies` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "א'-ב'" 36 210 0.0875, `promotion step` "ב'-ג'" 36 210 0.0875,
         `promotion step` "ג'-ד'" 36 210 0.0875

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-3__subpara_12-3-2
`promotion of certified non-academic principals and deputies` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "א'-ב'" 48 480 0.0875, `promotion step` "ב'-ג'" 48 480 0.0875,
         `promotion step` "ג'-ד'" 48 480 0.0875

-- 12.2.2 and 12.2.3 ¶2-¶3: who may advance at all. An uncertified academic
-- admitted by exception does not advance until certified, unless he has 25
-- years; a non-academic with up to 27 years who committed does not advance
-- until he presents the degree; with 28 or more he need not. The reading
-- adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_01-c): 25 years exempts — 3.2.1 bars only
-- "ותק בהוראה הנמוך מ-25 שנים". Veterans below 25, once certified, count
-- פז"נ and שפ"מ from their employment on the reform, for one promotion
-- only, and up to 60 hours of their studies; new teachers admitted by
-- exception count both from the certification.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_12-2-2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_12-2-3/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_12-2-3/p3
GIVEN t IS A `special-education teacher`
      `presented the academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may advance in grades` t `presented the academic degree` IF
    IF t's `holds an academic degree`
    THEN t's `holds a teaching certificate` OR t's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 25
    ELSE t's `seniority in teaching` AT LEAST 28 OR `presented the academic degree`

`study hours that count toward שפ"מ at most` MEANS 60

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_01-c: 12.2.2 bars veterans "בעלי ותק עד 25 שנה" and
-- exempts those "בעלי ותק של 25 שנה ומעלה": at 25 years, both.
GIVEN `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred under 12.2.2's first paragraph` `seniority` IF
    `seniority` AT MOST 25

GIVEN `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `exempt under 12.2.2's third paragraph` `seniority` IF
    `seniority` AT LEAST 25

`at 25 years 12.2.2 both bars and exempts` MEANS
    `barred under 12.2.2's first paragraph` 25 AND `exempt under 12.2.2's third paragraph` 25
#ASSERT `at 25 years 12.2.2 both bars and exempts`

§§ `13 יועצים חינוכיים`

-- 13.1: a counsellor works an academic teacher's week; the frontal hours
-- split between teaching and counselling as the principal sets; the
-- individual hours are counselling; at least 1/6 of the position (6 of 36)
-- in frontal teaching in primary and junior high, and at least 4 frontal
-- hours for any position fraction.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1
GIVEN `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the counsellor's least frontal teaching` `position` IS
    max (36 TIMES `position` DIVIDED BY 6) 4

-- 13.2: the new combined-salary tables for academic teachers apply to new
-- counsellors.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2
GIVEN `a new counsellor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid on the new academic teachers' combined-salary tables` `a new counsellor` IF
    `a new counsellor`

-- 13.3: with 7 counselling hours or more, a counselling allowance of 8%
-- (temporary licence) or 12% (permanent licence).

@ref akn:art_13__para_13-3
GIVEN `counselling hours` IS A NUMBER, `a permanent licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `counselling allowance rate` `counselling hours` `a permanent licence` IS
    IF `counselling hours` AT LEAST 7
    THEN IF `a permanent licence` THEN 0.12 ELSE 0.08
    ELSE 0

§§ `14 קביעת הדרגה באופק חדש`

-- 14.2-14.4: the grade rests on the employment, education and salary data;
-- the Ministry's accountant converts by the salary data of March in the
-- year before the teacher joins — seniority, grade, in-service training
-- allowances, roles and the conversion supplement by his status, as the
-- agreement sets; the salary to convert is the relevant components a 100%
-- position would earn by his roles that March (annex E 1(ב)).
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2 akn:art_14__para_14-3 akn:art_14__para_14-4
@desc The March salary data a grade is converted from (section 14.3).
DECLARE `conversion data` HAS
    `seniority of the data`                 IS A NUMBER
    `grade of the data`                     IS A NUMBER
    `in-service training allowances`        IS A NUMBER
    `roles held`                            IS A LIST OF STRING
    `conversion supplement by status`       IS A NUMBER

-- March of the school year before joining falls in the calendar year in
-- which the school year of joining begins.
GIVEN `school year of joining` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year in which the school year of joining begins
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the calendar year of the March converted` `school year of joining` IS
    `school year of joining`

-- 14.5: the grade set in the conversion may be a half grade.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-5
`grades may be halves` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:art_14__para_14-6 More information on the conversions and the owners' conferences will follow; annex E explains the conversion with examples; links to the אופק חדש tables and the 2016 shekel-supplement circular. A pointer, no rule.

-- 14.7: the role allowances of אופק חדש, as a percentage, one row per
-- printed line; "as today" (special-education teacher) is an input.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-7
DECLARE `role` IS ONE OF
    `second deputy principal`
    `homeroom teacher`
    `grade-1 homeroom teacher`
    `special-education teaching employee`
    `subject coordinator`
    `road-safety coordinator`
    `security coordinator`
    `social education`
    `grade-level coordinator`
    `laboratory coordinator`
    `measurement and evaluation coordinator`
    `trips coordinator`
    `inclusion and integration coordinator`
    `pedagogical coordinator`
    `mentor of interns`

DECLARE `stage of the role` IS ONE OF `in primary`, `in junior high`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_01-d: the grade-level coordinator's line prints two
-- rates, "7% / 6%", and an asterisk that leads to no note.
GIVEN r IS A `role`, s IS A `stage of the role`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the rates printed for` r s IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `second deputy principal` THEN LIST 0.13
    WHEN `homeroom teacher` THEN LIST 0.10
    WHEN `grade-1 homeroom teacher` THEN LIST 0.115
    WHEN `special-education teaching employee` THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `subject coordinator` THEN IF s EQUALS `in primary` THEN LIST 0.06 ELSE LIST 0.08
    WHEN `road-safety coordinator` THEN LIST 0.06
    WHEN `security coordinator` THEN LIST 0.06
    WHEN `social education` THEN IF s EQUALS `in primary` THEN LIST 0.06 ELSE LIST 0.10
    WHEN `grade-level coordinator` THEN LIST 0.07, 0.06
    WHEN `laboratory coordinator` THEN LIST 0.03
    WHEN `measurement and evaluation coordinator` THEN LIST 0.06
    WHEN `trips coordinator` THEN LIST 0.06
    WHEN `inclusion and integration coordinator` THEN LIST 0.06
    WHEN `pedagogical coordinator` THEN LIST 0.06
    WHEN `mentor of interns` THEN LIST 0.024

`the grade-level coordinator has two rates and no rule between them` MEANS
    count (`the rates printed for` `grade-level coordinator` `in primary`) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the grade-level coordinator has two rates and no rule between them`

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_01-d): the rate is an input until
-- the missing note is supplied, bounded by the two printed. The mentor's
-- 2.4% is per intern, for up to three; "as today" is an input; at most two
-- role allowances.
GIVEN r IS A `role`, s IS A `stage of the role`
      `the grade-level coordinator's rate` IS A NUMBER @desc 0.07 or 0.06: which applies is in a note the circular does not print
      `interns mentored` IS A NUMBER
      `the special-education rate as today` IS A NUMBER @desc the special-education teacher's allowance "as practised today"; an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role allowance rate` r s `the grade-level coordinator's rate` `interns mentored` `the special-education rate as today` IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `grade-level coordinator` THEN `the grade-level coordinator's rate`
    WHEN `mentor of interns` THEN 0.024 TIMES min `interns mentored` 3
    WHEN `special-education teaching employee` THEN `the special-education rate as today`
    OTHERWISE sum (`the rates printed for` r s)

`role allowances at most` MEANS 2

GIVEN `allowances held` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role allowances paid` `allowances held` IS
    sum (take `role allowances at most` `allowances held`)

§§ `15 מקדמות שכר באופק חדש עד לקביעת הדרגה`

-- 15.1: until the grade is set, the owner pays an advance ("מקדמת אופק
-- חדש") on top of the present salary, computed on these components, for
-- the share of employment in the special-education school that joined,
-- from the day of joining; once the grade is set, the salary is computed
-- back to joining and what was paid, the advance included, is offset.
DECLARE `advance kind` IS ONE OF
    `a primary teacher (or grades 1-6 of a multi-stage school)`
    `a primary intern`
    `a post-primary teacher (or grade 7 and up of a multi-stage school)`
    `a post-primary intern`
    `a first deputy`
    `a principal`

-- 15.2: the advance rates.
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-2
GIVEN k IS AN `advance kind`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `advance rate` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a primary teacher (or grades 1-6 of a multi-stage school)` THEN 0.17
    WHEN `a primary intern` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `a post-primary teacher (or grade 7 and up of a multi-stage school)` THEN 0.27
    WHEN `a post-primary intern` THEN 0.22
    WHEN `a first deputy` THEN 0.20
    WHEN `a principal` THEN 0.15

@ref akn:art_15__para_15-1
GIVEN k IS AN `advance kind`
      `the advance components of the present salary` IS A NUMBER @desc combined salary, the 87, 94, 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements, split, in-service training and double-degree allowances, in shekels
      `share of employment at the joined school` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the אופק חדש advance` k `the advance components of the present salary` `share of employment at the joined school` IS
    `advance rate` k
    TIMES `the advance components of the present salary`
    TIMES `share of employment at the joined school`

GIVEN `advance due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `paying the advance` `advance due` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the אופק חדש advance` `paid`
          PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `advance due`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/1 15.1: the advance is paid on top of the salary until the grade is set"

-- akn:art_15/p1 Instructions on the indemnity for the advance will follow in a separate circular; no rule here.

§§ `16 שעון הנוכחות בביה"ס`

-- 16.1-16.3: an attendance clock is installed; the teachers report their
-- hours on it (by hand until it is installed); hours count from clocking
-- in, and not before 7:45. 16.4: the owner pays and deducts by the clock,
-- after checking justified absences (sickness, mourning).
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-1 akn:art_16__para_16-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `reporting on the clock` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `report the hours on the attendance clock`

@ref akn:art_16__para_16-2
GIVEN `clock-in minute of the day` IS A NUMBER @desc minutes from midnight (7:45 = 465)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `work counts from minute` `clock-in minute of the day` IS
    max `clock-in minute of the day` 465

@ref akn:art_16__para_16-4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reform action`
DECIDE `paying by the clock` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay and deduct by the clock reports`

-- 17 (printed inside section 16 as art_16 ¶1): the circular gathers the
-- agreements' rules; where it contradicts them, for or against the
-- employee, the agreements govern.
@ref akn:art_16/p1
DECLARE `source` IS ONE OF `this circular`, `the collective agreements`

GIVEN `they contradict` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `source`
DECIDE `what governs` `they contradict` IS
    IF `they contradict` THEN `the collective agreements` ELSE `this circular`

-- akn:conclusions The signatures and copies list; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' כתב התחייבות`

-- Annex A: the owner's authorised signatory undertakes to apply, from
