-- amendments that concerns a special-education school — among them the
-- work week, the pay and the pedagogical instructions — at the schools
-- listed, and confirms he has read it; breach may bring sanctions up to the
-- licence (¶4, in the owner's first stage).
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 akn:att_1__hc_1/p7
DECLARE `what the owner undertakes` IS ONE OF
    `the אופק חדש work week`
    `pay by אופק חדש`
    `the pedagogical instructions of אופק חדש`
    `every other provision of אופק חדש that concerns a special-education school`

`the undertakings of annex A` MEANS
    LIST `the אופק חדש work week`, `pay by אופק חדש`, `the pedagogical instructions of אופק חדש`,
         `every other provision of אופק חדש that concerns a special-education school`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_01-i: the annex's title commits to joining "החל משנה"ל
-- תשפ"א" (¶1); its body undertakes to apply the reform "משנת הלימודים תש"ף
-- ואילך" (¶3). Years as the calendar year the school year begins in.
`the first year annex A's title gives` MEANS 2020
`the first year annex A's body gives` MEANS 2019

`annex A's title and body name different first years` MEANS
    NOT (`the first year annex A's title gives` EQUALS `the first year annex A's body gives`)
#ASSERT `annex A's title and body name different first years`

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_01-i): the body's תש"ף, the year
-- section 1 ¶6 says the reform applied from.
`the first year of the undertaking` MEANS `the first year annex A's body gives`

