`example 2's printed A` MEANS 18136.311
`example 2's placed salary` MEANS 17961.60

`example 2 places the deputy below A` MEANS
    `example 2's placed salary` LESS THAN `example 2's printed A`
#ASSERT `example 2 places the deputy below A`

